{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Shnanak Corp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where a simple pigeon monster from the cleaning staff is about to turn this monster-filled workplace upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/frat-showcase.gif?t=1743603856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a despised janitor who's tired of being stepped on and climb through Shnanak Corp. by <strong>devouring your enemies</strong> to gain rewards and <strong>become more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/fight-showcase.gif?t=1743603856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A turn-based combat with a clear and unique battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A roguelite with multiple factors, collecting cells and increasing your stats after eating each monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Event systems that allow you to modify cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple biomes that offer unique combat encounters in each sub-company within Shnanak Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A system of unique enemy-specific abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433240?t=1743603856","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743603856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/5704bdd338e0d5ecc4d8ccd2bc81f7bde3513cdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743603856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/5704bdd338e0d5ecc4d8ccd2bc81f7bde3513cdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743603856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Shnanak Corp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where a simple pigeon monster from the cleaning staff is about to turn this monster-filled workplace upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/frat-showcase.gif?t=1743603856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a despised janitor who's tired of being stepped on and climb through Shnanak Corp. by <strong>devouring your enemies</strong> to gain rewards and <strong>become more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/fight-showcase.gif?t=1743603856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A turn-based combat with a clear and unique battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A roguelite with multiple factors, collecting cells and increasing your stats after eating each monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Event systems that allow you to modify cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple biomes that offer unique combat encounters in each sub-company within Shnanak Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A system of unique enemy-specific abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Rat's Paradox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image"